  "source_passage": "Site navigation\nView Details opens an individual sample build detail page. The Skyline is at /builds/skyline, the Miata at /builds/miata, and the BMW at /builds/bmw. These pages show the example car and labeled modification categories. To look at the upgrades on one example car, open Car Builds and then View Details."
